===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|contre}}, {{m|enm|contree}}, {{m|enm|contreie}}, from {{der|en|fro|contree}}, from {{der|en|VL.|-}} ({{m|la|terra}}) {{m|la|contrāta||(land) lying opposite; (land) spread before}}, derived from {{der|en|la|contra||against, opposite}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|kintra}}. Unrelated to {{m|en|county}}. Displaced native {{m+|en|land}} in some of its senses.

